# DELIMITER-escape regression for byte literals: threading byte-ness through
# `parse_one_quoted_char` must NOT break `\'` / `\\` / `\n` / `\0` in `b'..'`
# (the SingleQuoted delimiter context still applies). Core #12 axis cell the
# earlier fixture list missed; the self-host uses `b'\''` so this pins the
# bootstrap too.
void main():
    print(b'\'')
    print(b'\\')
    print(b'\n')
    print(b'\0')
    print(b'A')
